        {
          "id": "glt8c6886qdz",
          "status": "identified",
          "body": "Payouts in NGN, GHS, KES, UGX, ZMW, RWF, TZS, GBP, USD and EUR have been restored, alongside merchant settlements, mobile money payments and key account features. However, payouts in MWK, EGP, XOF, XAF and ZAR, stablecoin balance visibility, airtime and bill payments remain affected as recovery continues.\n\nWe apologize for the inconvenience and appreciate your patience and understanding.\n\nAffected Services: \nAffected Markets: Global",
          "incident_id": "25rf98nhjkt3",
          "created_at": "2026-10-14T14:15:58.959Z",
