          ],
          "deliver_notifications": true,
          "custom_tweet": null,
          "tweet_id": null
        },
        {
          "id": "xdlwnb9z47lx",
          "status": "identified",
          "body": "Dear Valued Merchant, \n\nHere is our latest progress as services return. Payouts are confirmed working in NGN, GHS, UGX, ZMW, RWF, TZS, GBP and EUR, Mobile money payments, Account features: Balance visibility (excluding stablecoins), balance history, statement generation, transaction status checks, bank lists, low-balance notifications These services are not yet available: USD payouts, KES, MWK, EGP, XOF, XAF and ZAR payouts are still being restored and checked, Airtime and bill payments remain temporarily unavailable, Stablecoin balance visibility. \n\nUnder Review: FX rate visibility discrepancies between the dashboard and API We will keep you informed as further services are confirmed. \nPlease contact our support team if you see problems with any service listed as restored. \nWe apologize for the inconvenience and thank you for your understanding.",
          "incident_id": "25rf98nhjkt3",
          "created_at": "2026-10-14T09:42:54.580Z",
